The '''Pyroclastic Worm''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from Lava on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
The '''Pyroclastic Worm''' can be fished up from any Lava source on the Crimson Isle with a [[Fishing Rods|Lava Fishing Rod]]. It requires {{Skl|fishing|XXXI}} to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Pyroclastic Worm''' is {{Green|400}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|8.61%|1|11.62|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

